# Part Four — The One-Liner Bank

> About 120 one-liners in the style of the past MCQs. Each is a complete, checkable fact: the **key word** is in bold green and the **date** in bold navy. Read them aloud; cover the bold words and test yourself; then attempt every past MCQ below.

