## Every past MCQ on Topic 5

@py mcqs_topic 5

::: trap | Three MCQ traps in Topic 5
1. **Harassment: 2010, not 2006.** The workplace harassment law is ==2010==; the Women's Protection Act is ==2006==. Both appear often (the 2010 Act in five MCQs).
2. **"The paper states…".** Some MCQs quote figures from the paper itself (female literacy 48%, breast-cancer deaths 13,000). Choose the figure the stem attributes, even if newer data differ.
3. **Minimum marriage age.** Under the old **federal** law it is **16** for girls; Sindh (2013) and Islamabad (2025) set **18**. Read whether the stem asks for federal, provincial or Islamabad law.
:::
